    "dialogue": [
      {
        "id": "urban-gun",
        "speaker": {
          "kind": "cast",
          "castMemberId": "cast_sb5y4gjk"
        },
        "startFrame": 48,
        "endFrame": 155,
        "text": "A gun this size does not defend a wall. It changes the mind of the man approaching it.",
        "audio": {
          "assetFileId": "asset_file_tj2c5gmn",
          "offsetSeconds": 0.33333333333333326
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "loukas-treasurer",
        "speaker": {
          "kind": "cast",
          "castMemberId": "cast_p7y36x5t"
        },
        "startFrame": 172,
        "endFrame": 254,
        "text": "It changes the mind of the treasurer first.",
        "audio": {
          "assetFileId": "asset_file_tj2c5gmn",
          "offsetSeconds": 5.5
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "emperor-require",
        "speaker": {
          "kind": "cast",
          "castMemberId": "cast_pccfdknw"
        },
        "startFrame": 273,
        "endFrame": 299,
        "text": "What would you require?",
        "audio": {
          "assetFileId": "asset_file_tj2c5gmn",
          "offsetSeconds": 9.708333333333334
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "urban-requirements",
        "speaker": {
          "kind": "cast",
          "castMemberId": "cast_sb5y4gjk"
        },
        "startFrame": 310,
        "endFrame": 638,
        "text": "Bronze. Powder. Charcoal. Masons. Carpenters. Oxen. A foundry that can breathe without collapsing. And pay enough that my men do not sell the design before the mold dries.",
        "audio": {
          "assetFileId": "asset_file_tj2c5gmn",
          "offsetSeconds": 11.25
        }
      }
    ],
    "description": "## Blocking & camera\n\nSymmetrical master of the Imperial Council Chamber: the windows and a standing Urban on the left, Loukas Notaras and Constantine XI seated on the right, the icon wall behind them. Urban unrolls the bombard drawing across the table from 0.25 to 2 seconds, then leans over the table and points at it as he begins to speak, settling with his left hand braced on the table.\n\nCut to an overhead insert of the drawing at 4.17 s, to Loukas in close-up at 7.17 s, and to Constantine at 10.58 s; Constantine meets Urban's gaze and visibly asks his question. Urban's close-up starts at 12.92 s and holds through the materials list. Return to the master at 19.42 s on \"A foundry that…\". At 24 s Loukas leans toward Constantine's near ear; the inaudible whisper arrives at 25.5 s and holds to the end.\n\n## Dialogue & timing\n\n**2.00–6.46 s · Urban:** A gun this size does not defend a wall. It changes the mind of the man approaching it.\n\n**7.17–10.58 s · Loukas:** It changes the mind of the treasurer first.\n\n**11.38–12.46 s · Constantine:** What would you require?\n\n**12.92–26.58 s · Urban:** Bronze. Powder. Charcoal. Masons. Carpenters. Oxen. A foundry that can breathe without collapsing. And pay enough that my men do not sell the design before the mold dries.\n\nThe lines use the accepted dialogue recording (turns 2–5). The recorded video is silent.\n"
  },
